--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e506260db34f49179908081b2e26da92, type: 3}
  m_Name: Normal 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: Everyone thinks being the Mayor's son is all perks, but the pressure is
      actually annoying as hell.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Pressure to do what? Lean against the wall more professionally?
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: Funny. No, my Dad is always on my back about "legacy" and "public image."
      He wants me to have my whole life planned out by next week.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: So what do you actually want to do?
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "That\u2019s the thing, man, I have no clue. I just want to ride and hang
      out without someone asking me about my \"five-year plan.\""
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Well, figuring it out takes time. Most people don't know what they're doing
      at our age.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 6
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 6
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "Tell that to my Dad. He acts like if I\u2019m not running the town by
      twenty, I\u2019m a failure. It\u2019s easier to just act like I don't care
      than to try and fail his \"expectations.\""
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
